    "b0011-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "b1ce0771547b1109b1294959f92a86d5dbefb5394e3efcfb49abc303fc199dab",
      "targetHash": "8d77870dd16dec7cb065a47fb4e1cb4acf72b791e5e7c8f9242db266dc76ff46",
      "machineHash": "8d77870dd16dec7cb065a47fb4e1cb4acf72b791e5e7c8f9242db266dc76ff46",
      "machineText": "Aktifkan hosting visual dengan menetapkan `UseVisualHosting` dalam opsi Windows Anda. Dengan hosting visual, permukaan compositor WebView2 dimiliki melalui visual DirectComposition yang dimiliki host, sehingga perubahan konteks DPI tidak lagi memicu proses re-marshalling sinkron.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Enable visual hosting by setting `UseVisualHosting` in your Windows options. With visual hosting, We…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:32Z"
    },
    "b0012-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "0bd1231730bc139dd76f2ed8b6dd9d56cc4d39706b0106e0f79482d2e038b109",
      "targetHash": "4d554a5f7828f5a1016de52da6705d46af7995815c4e78cd992b01e9060bead3",
      "machineHash": "4d554a5f7828f5a1016de52da6705d46af7995815c4e78cd992b01e9060bead3",
      "machineText": "Setelah opsi ini diaktifkan, pop-up terbuka dalam waktu navigasi normal (sekitar 150 hingga 500 ms), dan menutup jendela tidak lagi memblokir jendela induk.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "After enabling it, popups open within normal navigation time (roughly 150 to 500 ms) and closing a w…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:32Z"
    },
    "b0013-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "1095da597effe3f8682fc0cc28877f584d5f150ee2c7683b436966b82db82087",
      "targetHash": "e0104efe649af3ce5a4c3a16b783591799143a1709f67dbe79aebed08690b897",
      "machineHash": "e0104efe649af3ce5a4c3a16b783591799143a1709f67dbe79aebed08690b897",
      "machineText": "`UseVisualHosting` harus ditetapkan sebelum `app.Run()`. Wails membacanya saat aplikasi dimulai dan menetapkan variabel lingkungan `COREWEBVIEW2_FORCED_HOSTING_MODE` ke `COREWEBVIEW2_HOSTING_MODE_WINDOW_TO_VISUAL` sebelum lingkungan WebView2 diinisialisasi. Menetapkannya setelah itu tidak akan berpengaruh.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`UseVisualHosting` must be set before `app.Run()`. Wails reads it during application startup and set…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:32Z"
    },
    "b0014-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "6175ac3099231cbf4b322158c3a55f5c5e89aee4c8c43a4737a904aabd7ea1d4",
      "targetHash": "3232cfa16e1e28693cdefbd127c3d11709addf029898fc73b5d8ffa588d435a4",
      "machineHash": "3232cfa16e1e28693cdefbd127c3d11709addf029898fc73b5d8ffa588d435a4",
      "machineText": "Nilai default opsi ini adalah `false`, sehingga hosting berjendela tetap menjadi mode default. Perilaku aplikasi yang sudah ada tidak berubah kecuali opsi ini diaktifkan secara eksplisit.",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The option defaults to `false`, so windowed hosting remains the default. Existing apps see no change…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:32Z"
    },
